Package: shinysnap
Title: Save and Restore the State of 'shiny' Applications
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Nan", "Xiao", email = "me@nanx.me", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0250-5673"))
    )
Description: Take a snapshot of the state of a running 'shiny' application,
    the current input values plus any server-side values you register, and
    write it to a plain, human-readable JSON file that can be shared, kept
    under version control, and hand-edited. Restore it later into a different
    session without a page reload and without bookmarking. Restoring waits for
    inputs rendered dynamically to appear, so no timing guesses are needed,
    and reports which values were applied, which never appeared, and which
    failed.
